WEBVTT

00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:15,490
Are there published studies or clinical studies that document results with the rife treatment?

00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:31,410
Not that I know of. There are some studies that have shown the benefits of

00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:45,570
of using electromagnetic field therapies. I posted one of them on our website that was published in

00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:54,050
2023 for colon cancer. There's another one that was published in 2019 on breast cancer, but it'll

00:00:54,050 --> 00:01:00,610
go specifically into any frequencies, rife frequencies, we should have talked about electromagnetic

00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:09,170
field therapies with frequencies. The issue with that is that in order to get clearance to do a study,

00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:20,290
we have to get FDA clearance. Unless you're like comparing it with doing it with

00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:27,970
chemotherapy or doing chemotherapy without it, you probably won't get clearance in NIH clearance to

00:01:27,970 --> 00:01:37,170
do a study. It takes hundreds of thousands to $1,000,000 to do something like that, but I don't

00:01:37,170 --> 00:01:45,730
propose that they will be anything in the future.

